'''The Red Malice''' (レッドヘルクマッチョ, ''Reddo Heru Kumaccho'', '''Red Hell Kumacho''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] variant of [[Teacher Bear]] introduced in [[Old Guys in the City (Monthly Event)|Old Guys in the City]]. He was added in [[Version 7.3 Update|Version 7.3]].

