==Trivia==
*It's unclear whether "The Red Malice" refers to the main bear or the group as a whole.
*His hair may be a reference to Gajeel from the anime and manga ''Fairy Tail''.
*He might be based on [[wikia:ginga:Akakabuto|Akakabuto]], the main antagonist from ''Ginga Nagareboshi Gin,'' as they both are large bears with a red mane, have two young cubs and both are missing their right eye.
*The cubs look similar to [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Teacher BearCat]], but with slightly thinner arms and larger feet.

